message: "If Aegis QEC contributes to your research, please cite this software and the decoder papers used by your experiment."
title: "Aegis QEC"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bahri"
    given-names: "Hamid"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamidbahri92/Aegis"
