abstract: "An open-source quantum error correction research platform integrating surface-code studies, Stim and PyMatching decoding, reusable datasets, paired comparisons, multi-objective adaptive discovery, evidence-bound research projects, and verifiable LaTeX submission packages."
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - QEC
  - surface code
  - rotated surface code
  - quantum decoding
  - minimum-weight perfect matching
  - sparse blossom
  - PyMatching
  - Stim
  - detector error model
  - fault-tolerant quantum computing
